<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on UBS.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on UBS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG said it has issued two million American-style call warrants on bearer shares of Union Bank of Switzerland.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,200 CHF		 PREMIUM	12.59 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     5.85 CHF		  GEARING	10.0 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 27.JAN.97-18.SEP.98   PAYDATE	22.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,170 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
